https://github.com/owner/repo 4f2a9c1e8b7d6a5f4e3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a39`),
				Example(caption: "A cycle, refused", captionPt: "Um ciclo, recusado", code: `$ hive check main.hive
lib/pricing.hive:1: this import forms a cycle:

    lib/inventory.hive
      -> lib/pricing.hive
      -> lib/inventory.hive`, codePt: `$ hive check main.hive
lib/pricing.hive:1: this import forms a cycle:

